@startuml party-entities-en
' SPDX-License-Identifier: Community-Spec-1.0
' Class diagram of the Party subject area: its entities and the references between them (spec/en/party.adoc, DMO-040 to DMO-047).
title Class diagram of the Party subject area
hide circle
hide methods
hide empty members
skinparam monochrome true
abstract class Party
class Person
class Organization
class PartyRole
class PartyRelationship
abstract class ContactMechanism
class PostalAddress
class TelephoneNumber
class TelephoneShortCode
class EmailAddress
class PartyContactMechanism
class PartyIdentification
class PartyClassification
Party <|-- Person
Party <|-- Organization
ContactMechanism <|-- PostalAddress
ContactMechanism <|-- TelephoneNumber
ContactMechanism <|-- TelephoneShortCode
ContactMechanism <|-- EmailAddress
PartyRole --> Party : partyId
PartyRelationship --> Party : partyId
PartyRelationship --> Party : relatedPartyId
PartyContactMechanism --> Party : partyId
PartyContactMechanism --> ContactMechanism : contactMechanismId
PartyIdentification --> Party : partyId
PartyClassification --> Party : partyId
legend bottom left
  Names in italics are abstract classes.
  A line with a hollow triangle points from a subclass to its parent class.
  A line with an open arrow points from an entity to the entity that it refers to.
  Its label is the slot that holds the identifier of that entity.
endlegend
@enduml
